m the worst.","intro_text":"<p>Most baby snacks compete on what they remove. Yummybara is built on what it puts in — and how it puts it in. GentleMelt™ is Singapore's first age-calibrated functional snacking system, combining melt-on-contact freeze-dried texture, integrated pre + probiotic gut support, and age-specific formulation into one approach engineered for developing bodies.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","intro_alignment":"left","intro_padding":30,"intro_border_radius":12,"intro_bg_color":"#f9f7f1","intro_subheading_color":"#192e59","intro_subheading_size":14,"intro_heading_color":"#3f4e1f","intro_heading_size":36,"intro_text_color":"#3f4e1f","intro_text_size":16,"image_text_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/melt_in_mouth_1.webp","image_text_subtitle":"THE FULL RANGE","image_text_title":"Coconut milk melts. Cheese melts. Freeze-dried fruit. Rusks. Treats.","image_text_text":"<p>Every product in the Yummybara range follows the same GentleMelt™ approach — melt-on-contact texture, pre + probiotic gut support, freeze-dried nutrient retention, and clean ingredient architecture calibrated to a specific developmental stage.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","image_text_gap":0,"image_text_content_padding":30,"image_text_border_radius":12,"image_text_bg_color":"#f9f7f1","image_text_subtitle_color":"#7a963a","image_text_subtitle_size":14,"image_text_title_color":"#3f4e1f","image_text_title_size":32,"image_text_text_color":"#665e53","image_text_text_size":16,"three_cards_gap":20,"three_card_padding":30,"three_card_border_radius":12,"three_card_border_width":1,"three_card_bg_color":"#eef3e6","three_card_border_color":"#eef3e6","three_card_subtitle_color":"#7a963a","three_card_subtitle_size":12,"three_card_badge_bg_color":"#7a963a","three_card_badge_text_color":"#ffffff","three_card_badge_size":12,"three_card_badge_radius":20,"three_card_title_color":"#3f4e1f","three_card_title_size":24,"three_card_text_color":"#665e53","three_card_text_size":14,"three_card_bullet_color":"#665e53","three_card_bullet_size":14,"three_card_bullet_icon_color":"#665e53","card_1_subtitle":"6M+","card_1_badge":"STAGE 1","card_1_title":"First Tastes","card_1_text":"<p>First texture introduction, emerging teeth, establishing gut microbiome.<\/p>","card_1_bullet_1":"1–3 melts per serving","card_1_bullet_2":"1–2× per week","card_1_bullet_3":"Inulin prebiotic integrated","card_2_subtitle":"12M+","card_2_badge":"STAGE 2","card_2_title":"Growing Confidence","card_2_text":"<p>Growing chewing confidence, expanding palate, more varied nutritional needs.<\/p>","card_2_bullet_1":"3–5 melts per serving","card_2_bullet_2":"Up to 3× per week","card_2_bullet_3":"Probiotic strains added","card_3_subtitle":"18M+","card_3_badge":"STAGE 3","card_3_title":"Independent Snackers","card_3_text":"<p>Greater independence, stronger gut, more complex flavour and texture tolerance.<\/p>","card_3_bullet_1":"Up to 1 pack per day","card_3_bullet_2":"Several times per week","card_3_bullet_3":"Calcium + protein layers","two_cards_gap":20,"two_card_padding":30,"two_card_border_radius":12,"two_card_border_width":1,"two_card_bg_color":"#d5e3b8","two_card_border_color":"#d5e3b8","two_card_title_color":"#3f4e1f","two_card_title_size":24,"two_card_bullet_color":"#7a963a","two_card_bullet_size":14,"cross_icon_color":"#e01111","check_icon_color":"#7a963a","left_card_title":"Without Yummybara","left_bullet_1":"Generic \"suitable from 6 months\" — one formula for every child at every age","left_bullet_2":"Dense textures that require chewing ability your baby hasn't developed yet","left_bullet_3":"Probiotic claims from cultures sprayed on after production — degraded before they reach your child","left_bullet_4":"Nutrition cooked out by heat processing before the snack reaches your child","right_card_title":"With Yummybara's GentleMelt™","right_bullet_1":"Age-specific formulation — 6m+, 12m+, 18m+ — matched to developmental stage right now","right_bullet_2":"Melt-on-contact texture safe before advanced chewing develops — dissolves on saliva contact every time","right_bullet_3":"Inulin prebiotic + probiotic strains integrated into the base formulation","right_bullet_4":"Freeze-dried nutrient lock retaining up to 97% of original vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_d2f0194_RR9mzq"],"name":"The Full Range","settings":{}},"1780144436b75a433a":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_d0114ae_wXVajh":{"type":"ai_gen_block_d0114ae","settings":{"container_max_width":1200,"container_padding_horizontal":20,"desktop_width_percent":100,"intro_heading":"<p>The baby snack industry has been solving the wrong problem.<\/p>","intro_heading_size":40,"intro_heading_color":"#f9f7f1","intro_text":"<p>You've stood in the baby food aisle. You've read every label. You know what to avoid. You've found snacks that tick every box.<br\/><em>And you've still had the 2am Google session.<\/em><br\/>It's not your fault. It's because the entire industry is built to answer the wrong question.<\/p>","intro_text_size":16,"intro_text_color":"#f9f7f1","intro_bg_color":"#3f4e1f","intro_padding_vertical":60,"intro_spacing":20,"formula_subheading":"THINK ABOUT FORMULA","formula_subheading_size":14,"formula_subheading_color":"#7a963a","formula_heading":"You wouldn't give Stage 3 formula to a 4-month-old. Every parent knows this.","formula_heading_size":32,"formula_heading_color":"#f9f7f1","formula_subtext":"But when it comes to baby snacks, the entire industry gives every child — from 6 months to 3 years — the same product, the same texture, and the same one-size-fits-all \"suitable from 6 months\" claim. A 7-month-old and an 18-month-old are not the same child. Their tummies are not the same tummy. Their gut microbiome is at a completely different stage.","formula_subtext_size":16,"formula_subtext_color":"#f9f7f1","formula_text":"One snack designed for all of them is a snack designed for none of them.","formula_text_size":14,"formula_text_color":"#f9f7f1","formula_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_41.webp","formula_image_radius":12,"formula_description":"Same logic. Different category.","formula_description_size":12,"formula_description_color":"#f9f7f1","formula_bg_color":"#3f4e1f","formula_card_bg":"#3f4e1f","formula_card_radius":12,"formula_card_padding":40,"formula_gap":40,"formula_padding_vertical":60,"formula_text_spacing":15,"label_heading":"<p>Here's what \"clean label\" actually doesn't guarantee.<\/p>","label_heading_size":36,"label_heading_color":"#f9f7f1","label_text":"<p>You've found a snack. Organic. No sugar. Short ingredient list. It passes every check. But can it answer these?<\/p>","label_text_size":16,"label_text_color":"#f9f7f1","label_bg_color":"#3f4e1f","label_padding_vertical":60,"label_spacing":30,"label_card_bg":"#677844","label_card_radius":12,"label_card_padding":30,"label_card_gap":20,"label_card_number_gap":15,"label_card_spacing":10,"label_card_number_size":24,"label_card_number_color":"#7a963a","label_card_title_size":20,"label_card_title_color":"#f9f7f1","label_card_text_size":14,"label_card_text_color":"#f9f7f1","label_card_1_number":"01","label_card_1_title":"Texture Safety","label_card_1_text":"Is the texture genuinely safe for your child's chewing ability at this specific age — or does it assume jaw development they don't have yet?","label_card_2_number":"02","label_card_2_title":"Digestive Compatibility","label_card_2_text":"Does the formulation support a developing gut — or stress it? Fibres fine for a toddler can cause real discomfort in an infant.","label_card_3_number":"03","label_card_3_title":"Nutritional Integrity","label_card_3_text":"After heat processing, how much of the nutrition on that label actually reaches your child? Most heat-sensitive vitamins are destroyed.","label_card_4_number":"04","label_card_4_title":"Acceptance","label_card_4_text":"Will your child actually eat it? Textures not designed for young palates get rejected — not eaten.","cost_heading":"<p>The hidden cost of getting snacking wrong.<\/p>","cost_heading_size":36,"cost_heading_color":"#f9f7f1","cost_bg_color":"#3f4e1f","cost_padding_vertical":60,"cost_spacing":30,"cost_card_bg":"#677844","cost_card_radius":12,"cost_card_padding":20,"cost_card_gap":15,"cost_card_number_gap":20,"cost_card_number_size":18,"cost_card_number_color":"#7a963a","cost_card_number_opacity":50,"cost_card_text_size":14,"cost_card_text_color":"#f9f7f1","cost_card_1_number":"1","cost_card_1_text":"The daycare call at 10AM because your baby has an upset tummy — and you're replaying exactly what they ate.","cost_card_2_number":"2","cost_card_2_text":"The rejected snack after rejected snack, wondering if your child is actually getting enough.","cost_card_3_number":"3","cost_card_3_text":"The late-night label-reading spiral.","cost_card_4_number":"4","cost_card_4_text":"The guilt of grabbing something convenient and not knowing if you made the right call.","cost_card_5_number":"5","cost_card_5_text":"The choking scare that made you swear off solid snacks for two weeks.","cost_text":"<p><em>Your child doesn't need a snack with nothing wrong with it. They need a snack designed for who they are right now.<\/em><\/p>","cost_text_size":18,"cost_text_color":"#eef3e6","cost_button_text":"Find The Right Snack For Your Child's Age","cost_button_link":"","cost_button_text_size":16,"cost_button_bg":"#7a963a","cost_button_hover_bg":"#000000","cost_button_text_color":"#ffffff","cost_button_radius":8,"cost_button_padding_vertical":15,"cost_button_padding_horizontal":40},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_d0114ae_wXVajh"],"name":"Formula section","settings":{}},"1780147229af673dd8":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_8abaa07_F8cFJ3":{"type":"ai_gen_block_8abaa07","settings":{"container_max_width":1200,"container_padding_horizontal":20,"intro_heading":"<p>Welcome to our product<\/p>","intro_text":"<p>Discover the amazing benefits of our carefully selected ingredients.<\/p>","intro_text_align":"left","intro_heading_si